===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|petitio principii|lit=an assumption from the beginning}}, [[calque]] of {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|τὸ ἐν ἀρχῇ αἰτεῖσθαι||to assume from the beginning}}.

